# Assets embedded with go:embed are hashed or compared byte-for-byte, so their
# checked-out bytes must not vary by platform. Migration checksums are recorded
# in schema_migrations and rejected as drift on mismatch, and genesis/guardrails
# hashes are chain constants that must be computed over the canonical bytes. A
# CRLF checkout on Windows changes both.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.plutus text eol=lf
*.vkey text eol=lf
